{"parse":{"title":"Master Adventurer","pageid":451152,"revid":2141048,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-stub\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Emoji Paimon&#39;s Paintings 02 Qiqi 2\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Emoji Paimon&#39;s Paintings 02 Qiqi 2.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Emoji_Paimon%27s_Paintings_02_Qiqi_2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f7/Icon_Emoji_Paimon%27s_Paintings_02_Qiqi_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240303114600\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-stub\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Master_Adventurer?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text&#95;&#95;comment\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</a>:\n<ul><li>Numbers: charge time reduction, distance to mine, time before ore mark expires</li>\n<li>Co-op behavior?\n<ul><li>Multiple players firing arrows at valid targets at the same time</li></ul></li></ul></div></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-stub\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Master Adventurer</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9d/Talent_Master_Adventurer.png/revision/latest?cb=20260408033526\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Master Adventurer\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9d/Talent_Master_Adventurer.png/revision/latest?cb=20260408033526\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9d/Talent_Master_Adventurer.png/revision/latest?cb=20260408033526 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9d/Talent_Master_Adventurer.png/revision/latest?cb=20260408033526 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Master Adventurer\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Master_Adventurer.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Master Adventurer.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Linnea\" title=\"Linnea\">Linnea</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When Linnea is not in combat, the charge time of her Aimed Shot is greatly decreased, and she will shoot an Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow instead. Different effects will occur depending on the targets hit:<br /><ul><li> Specific animals: Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow will be transformed into a special \"Net\" that can capture the essence and form of these animals, using them as a medium to manifest the animal's physical form again. The \"Net\" can only be used for a limited number of times each week. </li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Ore\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ore\">Ore</a> veins used in <a href=\"/wiki/Forging\" title=\"Forging\">forging</a>: Linnea will dispatch Lumi, who will quickly strike at the ore marked by the Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow, then collect the dislodged ore. If Lumi is not on the field, Linnea will summon her for a short duration to help obtain the ore.</li></ul><br />The DMG dealt to opponents by Linnea's Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow is reduced to 20% of her original Charged Arrow. Additionally, after firing a certain number of Ultra Convenient Quick Arrows within a short period of time, Linnea needs to take a temporary break before she can continue using them.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Master Adventurer</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Linnea\" title=\"Linnea\">Linnea</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMaster_Adventurer%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow has a charge time reduction of <span class=\"text-error\">?</span>%.</li>\n<li>The Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow can go through and hit entities within <a href=\"/wiki/Thunder_Barrier\" title=\"Thunder Barrier\">Thunder Barriers</a>.</li>\n<li>The Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow acts like an <a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Ubiquity_Net\" title=\"Omni-Ubiquity Net\">Omni-Ubiquity Net</a> when it hits animals that can be captured by it. However, animals caught this way do not count toward the <a href=\"/wiki/Zoo_Tycoon\" title=\"Zoo Tycoon\">Zoo Tycoon</a> achievements.\n<ul><li>The Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow can only be successfully used as such 5 times per week. Afterward, all would-be successful uses act as failed uses of the Omni-Ubiquity Net (creatures are <a href=\"/wiki/Startle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Startle\">startled</a> but not killed) and will trigger the following dialogue: <span class=\"audio-button custom-theme focusable\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/49/Vo_linnea_talents_01.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20260518173903\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Vo linnea talents 01.ogg\">Media:vo linnea talents 01.ogg</a></span> <i>I'm all out of nets... Better call it a week!</i></li>\n<li>Upon successfully capturing an animal, the following text will appear on-screen: <i>Come along, little one!</i></li></ul></li>\n<li>Lumi will only be dispatched to mine ore if the Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow hits an ore used in forging (these ores are also the ones marked by other <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passives</a> that they say mark ores used in forging). She will likewise only instantly mine such ores.\n<ul><li>Lumi will neither be dispatched for nor instantly mine any other Geo objects, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Local_Specialties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Local Specialties\">Local Specialties</a> or the rocks encasing <a href=\"/wiki/Geograna\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Geograna\">Geograna</a>. However, Lumi can still deal damage to them if they are near an ore that is marked with the Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow.</li>\n<li>Lumi will only be dispatched for an ore marked with the Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow if the player if within <span class=\"text-error\">?</span>m of it.</li>\n<li>The Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow will only mark an ore for a maximum of 8&#8205;<sup><span title=\"This claim needs verification\">[<i>ver&#173;i&#173;fi&#173;ca&#173;tion need&#173;ed</i>]</span></sup> seconds.</li>\n<li>Only one ore can be marked at a time by the Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow.</li></ul></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Co-Op_Mode\" title=\"Co-Op Mode\">Co-Op Mode</a>, Lumi only collects ores for the player who dispatched her.\n<ul><li>Ores for other players are also not grouped, despite the animation.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If the Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow hits a target that can be marked or captured (even if unsuccessful), then it will not deal damage.</li>\n<li>Ultra Convenient Quick Arrows are charged if Linnea begins charging her Charged Attack outside of combat.\n<ul><li>If Linnea begins charging while in combat and then leaves combat without having fired the arrow she was charging, then that arrow will be a normal Charged Attack when it is fired, even if it is fully charged, and even if it finished charging outside of combat.</li>\n<li>Likewise, if Linnea begins charging outside of combat and then fires that arrow after entering combat, the arrow will still be an Ultra Convenient Quick Arrow.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Lumi collects the ores in real time, matching the animation.\n<ul><li>The player still has the option of collecting ores manually before Lumi collects them.</li>\n<li>If Linnea dies or is swapped out of the party before all ores are collected, Lumi is immediately despawned and the player must manually collect the remaining ores, including any ores that were on their way to Lumi when she despawned.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMaster_Adventurer%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Master Adventurer</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">大师级的冒险者</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Dàshījí de Màoxiǎnzhě</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Master-Level Adventurer</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">大師級的冒險者</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Dàshījí de Màoxiǎnzhě</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">超ベテラン冒険者</span><br /><small><i>Chou Beteran Boukensha</i></small></td><td>Super-Veteran Adventurer</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">모험</span> <span lang=\"ko\">마스터</span><br /><small><i>Moheom Maseuteo</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Aventurera maestra</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Aventuri<span lang=\"fr\">è</span>re experte</td><td>Expert Adventurer</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Искатель</span> <span lang=\"ru\">приключений</span> <span lang=\"ru\">экстра</span>-<wbr /><span lang=\"ru\">класса</span><br /><small><i>Iskatel' priklyucheniy ekstra-klassa</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Master Adventurer</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Nhà Mạo Hiểm Bậc Thầy</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Abenteuerexpertin</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Master Adventurer</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Grande Mestre Aventureira</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Usta Macerac<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Avventuriera esperta</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMaster_Adventurer%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_VI\" title=\"Version/Luna VI\">Version \"Luna VI\"</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Master_Adventurer/Change_History?action=edit\">Edit History</a>]</div></div><div class=\"change-history-content standard-border\"><a href=\"/wiki/Version_%22Luna_VII%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Version &quot;Luna VII&quot;\">Version \"Luna VII\"</a>\n<ul><li>The vertical range of Lumi's strike when dispatched by this Talent for what it can instantly mine was updated to be the same as what it can damage. Previously, the strike had a greater vertical range for what it could damage than for what it could instantly mine, which caused Lumi to damage higher and lower ore on sloped terrain without instantly mining it.</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Version_%22Luna_VI%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Version &quot;Luna VI&quot;\">Version \"Luna VI\"</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Master Adventurer was released.</li></ul></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMaster_Adventurer%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks mw-collapsible navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div class=\"hidden\" style=\"float:left;width:6em;text-align:left\">&#160;</div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Constellation\" title=\"Constellation\